      "control_name": "OIDC Federation Trust Must Be Scoped to Specific Repository",
      "control_description": "IAM roles that trust OIDC identity providers (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Bitbucket Pipelines) must restrict the subject claim to a specific repository and branch. A trust policy that accepts any repository from the provider allows any project in the provider's namespace to assume the role — a compromised or malicious repository becomes a production ingress path.\n",
