      "remediation": {
        "description": "OIDC trust policy accepts any repository from the identity provider. Any CI/CD pipeline in the provider's namespace can assume this production role.",
        "action": "Add a StringEquals or StringLike condition on the sub claim to restrict to specific repositories and branches. Example for GitHub Actions: \"token.actions.githubusercontent.com:sub\": \"repo:org/repo:ref:refs/heads/main\"",
